{'symbol': 'DUK', 'date': '2023-04-04 06:30:00', 'title': 'DUKE ENERGY PRICES OFFERING OF $1.5 BILLION OF 4.125% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C. , APRIL 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUKE ENERGY CORPORATION (NYSE: DUK) ("DUKE ENERGY") ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF ITS OFFERING OF $1.5 BILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 4.125% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 (THE "CONVERTIBLE NOTES") IN A PRIVATE PLACEMENT UNDER THE SECURITIES ACT OF 1933, AS AMENDED (THE "SECURITIES ACT").'}